// Game: Postretro
// Format: Standard
// Eight-source mandatory-residency stress fixture with a matched baseline.
// All source regions lie within 8 metres of each other and one 32 metre lead radius.
// Four routes are classic and four are 90 degree seamless; sources 4 through 7 start disabled.
// Use the southwest source-room pad to arm all eight. A peer standing in a disabled source shifts next tick.
// Destination rooms are distinct sealed lighting regions over 100 metres from the source room.
// Each room has an interior pillar so its playable partition offers portal-linked camera cells.
// Destination body centers are 40 units above the floor. Source zero alone plays fixtures/jump.
// For repeated measurements reload the map or place the camera explicitly; no return routes are added.
// The baseline removes only teleporters and their destination points. Geometry, lights and scripts match.
